I just want a coffee, please. I'll have it here.

00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:56.320
- A coffee? - But yours will arrive very well.

00:01:56.320 --> 00:01:59.210
- May I? - I'd rather you didn't.

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:00.000
No, no, no.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.390
personal is that when one is pregnant everyone wants to touch you without

