ask even though I did ask you for a coffee

00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:18.830
thank you hello a glass of warm milk to take warm milk to take warm milk

00:02:18.830 --> 00:02:25.940
to take you said warm milk is disgusting seriously and what would you ask for a latte

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:30.000
double with vanilla a latte you did not know that coffee affects

