I'm fine, small rashes, maybe a dislocated shoulder.

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:08.920
Where is Kevin? Did they bring him?

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:10.060
Don't worry, they'll find him.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:11.260
- I'm available. - Cubicle two.

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:13.400
