00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:15.520
Complete analysis for four units of blood.

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:17.370
- We're going to intubate him. - Peter, what do we have?

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:19.870
Rashes in the chest, there is deficiency in the left lung.

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:22.170
Pressure 100/60, pulse 120.

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:24.710
- Please help me! - We'll do it, what's your name?

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:28.250
Forget that, it hurts! I want to talk to the administrator.

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.000
