00:06:11.320 --> 00:06:12.900
Mrs. Keeney, we're going to look for your daughter,

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:14.960
but you have to tell me where she hurts.

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:17.620
In her chest. I can't breathe.

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:20.640
-Is there strong pain here? -No. Not there.

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:22.280
Oxygenation 88 in 10 liters.

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:25.530
Low vascular volume. I'll intubate four of Berset and 100 of Sux.

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:28.290
We'll apply a medication. She's going to fall asleep.

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:30.000
When she wakes up, she'll have a tube in her throat.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:34.140
that will allow him to breathe, a x-ray, and I need an ultrasound.

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:39.380
Dr. Correia, I'm in. This gentleman wants to see you.

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:41.520
Charles Cameron, from Roche.

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:44.710
- And we're going to have coffee. - Oh, of course, I'm sorry.

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:46.680
I'm a little busy.

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:49.520
- Can I stay? - Oh, of course, of course, it's fine.

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:51.780
- Dr. Cameron, Dr. Mark Green. - Hello.

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:53.910
- Hello. - Hello.

00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:57.750
I'll answer this call. I'll be right back.

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:02.880
I forgot we were going to have coffee.

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:05.160
It's an interview for Rush.

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:06.170
An interview for...

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:07.840
Cardiothoracic.

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:09.920
I thought you'd work with Romano.

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:11.280
Yes, there you have it.

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:12.700
A terrible prospect.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:15.400
I thought it was a good idea to analyze other opportunities.

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:17.570
It's true, it could be a good idea.

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:20.110
I'm sorry, I thought I mentioned it.

00:07:20.110 --> 00:07:21.860
You don't have to tell me everything.

00:07:21.860 --> 00:07:24.750
I'm looking for a five-year-old girl, Michelle Kinney.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:26.800
She's not here. I'm looking for a skater.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:28.600
I'm also looking for him, is that okay?

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:30.000
If the wash is positive, I'll take him.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.200
- We'll take you to the operating room. - Okay, I'll tell your girlfriend.

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:35.600
Dr. Anspock has a call, something about modifications to the report of...

