And they call in the middle of an emergency?

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:38.500
God!

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:41.500
The annoying daily routine of this place.

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:44.000
- Do you want to finish with the laundry, Carter? - Yes, of course.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.690
Yes.

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.720
- Will you ask him? - What?

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:50.900
- Yes. - About the rumor that he will resign as a staff member.

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:51.820
What?

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:55.000
